                  >process_isolation</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                │&nbsp;&nbsp;└── <span class="text-white"
                  >low_latency</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                │&nbsp;&nbsp;└── <span class="text-white"
                  >quantitative_finance</span>
              </div>  
              <div>
                └── <span class="text-[#D4C594]/80">remote/</span>
